 "title": "PZ127 series: 1.27 mm pitch two-row pin header, vertical surface mount, 1.0 mm housing (PZ127-2-07-S is the 2 × 7 size)",
 "source": {
  "document": "Outline drawing PZ127-2-N-S-1.0-XX (L5.3)",
